--              -> DNAR decision challenged by the daughter; review, explain, listen (key c).
-- NG-JUS-2225  untrained procedure       previously 0.62 vs NG-FND-2687 -> patient access to her own record (key b).
-- NG-JUS-2202  declining/accepting      previously 0.57 vs NG-MHN-0797 -> unsafe staffing assignment, escalate in writing (key b).
-- NG-JUS-2198  near-miss disclosure      previously 0.45 vs NG-MAN-0873, 0.36 vs NG-PCM-0676/PKD-1231/TRD-2095
--              -> consent-form witness attests to signature and freedom (key c).
-- NG-JUS-2195  stop dressing            previously 0.42 vs NG-FAM-1709 -> patient valuables, listed, witnessed, secured (key a).
