-- Batch 67: answer cue, tranche four.
--
-- Batch 67 — answer-length cue, tranche four (10 items, 1.71 to 1.75 before).
-- Keyed option cut back to the statement it makes, the explanation left in the rationale,
-- each distractor extended so it states the mechanism or setting it presumes.
-- No key letter changed: NUT-3104 a, NCX-0019 a, CARDIO-0008 d, ADV-0141 c, ADV-0189 c,
