--   0219 = MAT-0010  PPH, full bladder  -> placenta praevia: withhold the vaginal examination (key c) [0219 was also ambiguous: a soft fundus with displacement has two right answers]
--   0237 (NUT, batch 72) duplicated NCX-0180 on four-hour hang time
--        -> re-written as why the tube is marked at the nose (key d)
