--                       CLINICAL-0064 now takes cryptococcal meningitis
--                       in advanced HIV - weeks of headache, not hours.
-- paediatric dosing     MOD-PAED-020 keeps the amoxicillin calculation.
--                       MOD-PHARM-006 now takes allopurinol: start low,
--                       and check the azathioprine before the first dose.
-- needlestick           IPC-0023 keeps soap, water and report. RESP-0014
--                       now takes bubble CPAP - it splints alveoli open,
--                       and the nurse watches nose, abdomen and chest.
-- drowning              EMG-0066 keeps the five rescue breaths. CLP-2896
--                       now takes yaws - a painless crusted ulcer in a
--                       child, one penicillin injection, treat the house.
-- TPN running out       MOD-NUTR-019 keeps the D10W answer. MOD-GI-016
--                       now takes SBP prophylaxis in cirrhotic ascites.
-- catheter CAUTI        MOD-RENAL-011 keeps the closed-system care.
--                       MOD-FUND-013 now takes a pulse oximeter on cold
--                       painted fingers, which is lying.
-- postpartum bleeding   MAT-2313 keeps the genital tract tear. MNH-3042
--                       now takes uterine inversion - the mass in the
--                       vagina and the cord that must not be pulled.
-- Plant Medicine        TCM-0684 keeps the Mampong-Akuapem answer.
--                       TRD-2094 now takes the herbal vaginal preparation
--                       that burns healing tissue.
-- 
-- FLD-2174 was the same 26 kg child as DRC-2396 under two names for the
-- same calculation. It is now a 34 kg child, 74 mL per hour.
-- 
-- Kept: the two acid-base gases (different results), the two risk ratios
-- (1.8 and 0.85), the two drip-rate sums, catheter asepsis, praevia
-- diagnosis against the no-digital-exam action, and malnutrition feeding
