-- heat stroke           FND-2663 keeps the recognition. CLP-2901 now
--                       takes Ludwig's angina - the brawny floor of mouth
--                       after a toothache.
-- post-strep nephritis  KID-3204 keeps the diagnosis with monitoring.
--                       CLN-2924 now takes postnatal iron deficiency after
--                       delivery blood loss.
-- fixed dilated pupil   NEURO-0008 keeps the escalation. NCX-0304 now
