-- Batch 135: 40 INFO + RSCH items quoted, four wrong keys.
--
-- INFO + RSCH module block: 40 items quoted, 29 keys de-throned.
-- Four WRONG KEYS corrected - the first since batch 125:
--   INFO-003  keyed the payroll/HR option; DHIMS-2 is the district health
--             information system, so the aggregating option (now b) is correct.
--   INFO-004  keyed double-billing; the copy-and-paste hazard is carried-forward
--             findings masking deterioration (now a).
--   RSCH-004  keyed "manipulation and control alone"; a true RCT also needs
--             random allocation (now a).
