-- fail-bullet describing a sentence search for a phrase-searching option;
-- RSCH-009 and RSCH-016 carried raw LaTeX ($\alpha$, $\ge 0.90$, $p < 0.05$).
-- 29 key-longest items closed on distractor lengthening only; no key trimmed.
