-- FIVE DUPLICATES, each keyed on the same answer as an item already in the bank,
-- rewritten onto points no other item keys (second-best gap.py match 0.18 to 0.31):
-- 
--   0035  was airborne precautions in a negative-pressure room for suspected
--         measles, already keyed by IPC-005, COMM-006, NCX-0722 and MCB-2512 for
